# Access control lists for the control broker in the two-broker fallback.
#
# The same roles, with the observation branch simply absent: there is no obs/ traffic on
# this broker at all, so cross-contamination is prevented here by there being nothing to
# contaminate. The rules that remain are the control namespace's, and they are the same
# rules as on the single broker.
#
# The sensor role appears because of ADR-0009: a component that cannot receive a clock
# sample has no simulation time. On this broker that is the only thing a sensor may do,
# and it may still publish nothing anywhere.

user drogna_sensor
topic read ctl/clock

user drogna_ingest
topic read ctl/clock
topic write ctl/heartbeat
topic write ctl/telemetry

user drogna_control
topic readwrite ctl/#

user drogna_viewer
topic read ctl/#
